  "Use name change data from PlayerTrack to create player links.\n\n": "使用 PlayerTrack 的改名记录自动关联玩家。\n\n",
  "Use the manual tab to create player links by hand or to track": "通过手动标签添加玩家关联，或补充",
  " un-covered auto link scenarios such as personal character alias changes, track known alt characters or to override mistakes.\n\nEnter format as <player name> <home world>": "自动关联未覆盖的情况，例如自身改名、已知小号或修正错误。\n\n输入格式：<角色姓名> <所属服务器>",
  "Enabling these options will cache your entire match history in memory. Can help with refresh performance at the cost of increased memory usage.": "启用后会在内存中缓存全部战绩，提高刷新速度，同时增加内存占用。",
  "1st row: average per match.\n2nd row: average per minute.\n3rd row: median team contribution per match.": "第一行：场均数值。\n第二行：每分钟数值。\n第三行：单局队伍贡献比例的中位数。",
  "Comma-separate tags. Hit enter to save and close.\n\n'Append' will add all listed tags (if not present) to all matches.\n'Remove' will remove all listed tags (if present) from all matches.\n'Overwrite' will overwrite all tags on all matches with the listed tags.": "标签用英文逗号分隔，按回车保存并关闭。\n\n“追加”：为所选对局添加不存在的标签。\n“移除”：从所选对局删除指定标签。\n“覆盖”：用输入的标签替换所选对局的全部标签。",
  "This is calculated from discrepancies from the scoreboard and will includes DoTs, HoTs, reflected damage (e.g. Chiten), actions that land after the scoreboard calculates, ": "此值由结算与已记录事件的差额计算，包括持续伤害、持续治疗、反伤（如地天）、结算统计后才生效的技能、",
  "sources of damage/healing that the server does not tell the client about and data missing from incomplete match recordings.": "服务器未向客户端报告的伤害／治疗来源，以及记录不完整时缺失的数据。",
  "\n\nRESEARCH NOTES: ": "\n\n统计说明：",
  "\n* Sacred Claim heals are attributed to the targeted players on the scoreboard. ": "\n* 结算中的“神圣请求”治疗量计入被治疗的玩家。",
  "\n* HoTs and DoTs will only be counted if the source player is alive. ": "\n* 持续治疗和持续伤害仅在来源玩家存活时计数。",
  "\n* Medkits are not counted.": "\n* 不包含医疗道具包。",
  "\n* Sole Survivor is not counted. Also will count twice per proc for HP and MP gain.": "\n* 不包含“死斗”，其每次触发的体力和技力恢复还会重复计数。",
  "\n* Everlasting Flight heal will not have a source if the SMN dies before it expires.": "\n* 若召唤师在“不死鸟之翼”结束前死亡，其治疗事件将没有来源。",
