  "\nun-covered auto link scenarios such as personal character alias changes, track known alt characters or to override mistakes.\n\nEnter format as <player name> <home world>": "自动关联未覆盖的情况，例如自身改名、已知小号或修正错误。\n\n输入格式：<角色姓名> <所属服务器>",
  "Enabling\nthese options will cache your entire match history in memory. Can help with refresh performance at the cost of increased memory usage.": "启用后会在内存中缓存全部战绩，提高刷新速度，同时增加内存占用。",
  "1st\nrow: average per match.\n2nd row: average per minute.\n3rd row: median team contribution per match.": "第一行：场均数值。\n第二行：每分钟数值。\n第三行：单局队伍贡献比例的中位数。",
  "Comma-separate\ntags. Hit enter to save and close.\n\n'Append' will add all listed tags (if not present) to all matches.\n'Remove' will remove all listed tags (if present) from all matches.\n'Overwrite' will overwrite all tags on all matches with the listed tags.": "标签用英文逗号分隔，按回车保存并关闭。\n\n“追加”：为所选对局添加不存在的标签。\n“移除”：从所选对局删除指定标签。\n“覆盖”：用输入的标签替换所选对局的全部标签。",
  "This\nis calculated from discrepancies from the scoreboard and will includes DoTs, HoTs, reflected damage (e.g. Chiten), actions that land after the scoreboard calculates, ": "此值由结算与已记录事件的差额计算，包括持续伤害、持续治疗、反伤（如地天）、结算统计后才生效的技能、",
  "sources\nof damage/healing that the server does not tell the client about and data missing from incomplete match recordings.": "服务器未向客户端报告的伤害／治疗来源，以及记录不完整时缺失的数据。",
  "\n\nRESEARCH\nNOTES: ": "\n\n统计说明：",
  "\n*\nSacred Claim heals are attributed to the targeted players on the scoreboard. ": "\n* 结算中的“神圣请求”治疗量计入被治疗的玩家。",
  "\n*\nHoTs and DoTs will only be counted if the source player is alive. ": "\n* 持续治疗和持续伤害仅在来源玩家存活时计数。",
